                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "To also not include current buffer, use `if buf_info.listed == 1 and buf_info.bufnr ~= cur_buf_id then` with `local cur_buf_id = vim.api.nvim_get_current_buf()` initialized before the cycle.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">To also not include current buffer, use <code class=\"notranslate\">if buf_info.listed == 1 and buf_info.bufnr ~= cur_buf_id then</code> with <code class=\"notranslate\">local cur_buf_id = vim.api.nvim_get_current_buf()</code> initialized before the cycle.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "To also not include current buffer, use if buf_info.listed == 1 and buf_info.bufnr ~= cur_buf_id then with local cur_buf_id = vim.api.nvim_get_current_buf() initialized before the cycle.",
